    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Industrial process</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Application</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Haber&#39;s process</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> synthesis</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Ostwald&#39;s process</td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Aluminium extraction</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Contact process</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> synthesis</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Hall-Heroult process</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> synthesis</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
